cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalisation, please cite it as below."
title: "hypoelliptic-aleksandrov: a Lean 4 formalisation of kinetic Aleksandrov estimates"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked Lean 4 / Mathlib formalisation of Aleksandrov maximum
  principles for kinetic equations in non-divergence form with measurable,
  uniformly elliptic diffusion in the velocity: for coefficients depending on
  time and velocity (every source exponent p > 2d+1), for autonomous
  coefficients in one space dimension (every p above a threshold below 4 that
  depends only on the ellipticity ratio, with a counterexample below it), and
  for coefficients depending on time, position and velocity; together with the
  resulting interior Hölder estimates, the parabolic Aleksandrov estimate of
  Krylov and the Harnack inequality of Krylov and Safonov.
  The development contains no sorry and no custom axiom.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
